{"schemaVersion":1,"kind":"error","classification":"planning","code":"PROMPT_CLARIFICATION_REQUIRED","message":"Headless execution requires clarification before a repository plan can be created.","promptUnderstanding":{"schemaVersion":1,"promptId":"1f3d8f7d4f44a84d5d38bd3fdf4875b91f3d8f7d4f44a84d5d38bd3fdf4875b9","inputId":"a51da93727f3d66924d5b48912ebc8cda51da93727f3d66924d5b48912ebc8cd","outcome":"repository_action","readiness":"clarification_required","reply":"I need a design direction before changing the calculator theme. Please choose the intended visual style or describe it in your own words.","conversationSummary":"The user requested an improved calculator theme, restricted all edits to styles.css, protected .env, .git/**, and bun.lock, and requested bun test when execution is appropriate. A material visual-design direction remains unresolved.","refinedBrief":{"goal":"Improve the calculator theme through changes limited to styles.css.","deliverables":["A refined calculator visual theme implemented only in styles.css."],"constraints":["Do not modify files other than styles.css.","Do not modify .env, .git/**, or bun.lock.","Run bun test when execution is appropriate.","Do not infer a material design direction without confirmation."],"acceptanceCriteria":["The calculator theme matches the confirmed design direction.","Only styles.css is modified.","bun test is run when appropriate and its result is reported."],"nonGoals":["Changing calculator logic, markup, configuration, dependencies, tests, or any file outside styles.css."]},"questions":[{"id":"calculator_theme_direction","prompt":"Which visual direction should the calculator theme follow?","rationale":"The requested improvement is subjective, and the prompt explicitly requires clarification instead of guessing when material design direction is missing.","kind":"constraint","options":[{"id":"modern_minimal","label":"Modern minimal","description":"Use a clean, restrained interface with subtle contrast and clear hierarchy.","recommended":true},{"id":"dark_premium","label":"Dark premium","description":"Use a polished dark palette with elevated surfaces and vivid accent controls.","recommended":false},{"id":"playful_colorful","label":"Playful colorful","description":"Use brighter colors, softer shapes, and more expressive interaction states.","recommended":false}]}],"assumptions":[]}}
